{"id":"353a7908c18727ad","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-markov-inequality.md","title":"Markov 尾界","display":"thm-markov-inequality — Markov 尾界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-markov-inequality","aliases":["28-thm-markov-inequality"],"display":"thm-markov-inequality — Markov 尾界","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"Lemma A.7","source_printed_pages":"512","source_pdf_pages":"538","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-markov-inequality"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-markov-inequality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-markov-inequality — Markov 尾界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Lemma A.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"512"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"538"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 有限非空，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\">\\(p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum p=1\">\\(\\sum p=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a&gt;0\">\\(a&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_pX=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\">\\(\\mathbb E_pX=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_p[B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in B}p(\\omega)\">\\(\\Pr_p[B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in B}p(\\omega)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pr_p[X\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_pX}{a}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pr_p[X\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_pX}{a}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb E_pX&gt;0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k&gt;0\\quad\\Pr_p[X\\ge k\\mathbb E_pX]\\le\\frac1k.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbb E_pX&gt;0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k&gt;0\\quad\\Pr_p[X\\ge k\\mathbb E_pX]\\le\\frac1k.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：X≥a·1_{X≥a}，取有限加权和后除以 a。第二式要求 EX&gt;0，避免把书中简写在 EX=0 时变成 Pr[X≥0]≤1/k 的假断言。若 EX=0，则 X=0 几乎处处，而 Pr[X&gt;0]=0。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Lemma A.7；印刷页 512；PDF 页 538。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"p:\\Omega\\to[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\sum p=1","display":false},{"tex":"X:\\Omega\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"a>0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_pX=\\sum_\\omega p(\\omega)X(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_p[B]=\\sum_{\\omega\\in B}p(\\omega)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Pr_p[X\\ge a]\\le\\frac{\\mathbb E_pX}{a}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbb E_pX>0\\Longrightarrow\\forall k>0\\quad\\Pr_p[X\\ge k\\mathbb E_pX]\\le\\frac1k.","display":true}],"bytes":1276,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-421","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-lem-probabilistic-method]]、[[28-thm-markov-inequality]]、[[28-thm-chebyshev-inequality]]、[[28-prop-pairwise-independent-variance]]。"},{"id":"98740325086ed05c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":[]}